<page-meta page-style="{{guideLock}}"/>
<view class="page visit-page fade-in {{guideMotion}}"><view class="eyebrow">GU YUAN TOU / 慢行提案</view><view class="title">循水，入村。</view><view class="subtitle">把四处风景，连成一段自己的旅程。</view><view class="demo-badge">虚拟路线演示 · 未接入真实导航</view><view class="route-canvas"><view class="route-line"/><view class="route-caption serif">树 · 水 · 屋 · 书</view><view wx:for="{{stops}}" wx:key="id" class="route-stop {{selected===item.id ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="select"><view class="stop-marker">{{index+1}}</view><image src="{{item.image}}" mode="aspectFill" lazy-load/><view class="stop-copy"><text>0{{index+1}} / {{index===3 ? '终章' : '慢行一站'}}</text><view class="serif">{{item.name}}</view><text>{{selected===item.id ? '当前选中 · 点击下方阅读' : '轻触选择这一站'}}</text></view></view></view><view class="panel route-summary"><view class="row"><view class="serif">{{stops[selected].name}}</view><text class="gold small">0{{selected+1}} / 04</text></view><view class="small muted">路线顺序仅作游览示意，不代表实际方位、距离或通行情况。</view><view class="button-row"><button class="outline" bindtap="demo">导航演示</button><button class="primary" bindtap="open">阅读这一站</button></view></view><view class="footnote">慢一点，才看得见日常里的风景。</view></view>
<village-pet id="pet"/>
